  "descriptionShort": "The mean income or consumption per day within the poorest decile (tenth of the population).",
  "descriptionProcessing": "Income and consumption averages by decile are not directly available in the World Bank PIP API. We calculate the metric by multiplying the share of each decile by the mean income or consumption of the distribution and dividing by the population share of the decile (10%).",
